WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:57.787
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:58.057 --> 01:00.494
Thanks for looking this over. You're a lifesaver.

3
01:00.577 --> 01:03.994
I have to get this press release revised by the end of the day.

4
01:04.077 --> 01:06.094
I'm just glad I could help.

5
01:06.177 --> 01:07.857
Let me know anytime you need a hand.

6
01:08.597 --> 01:11.914
Even a single word choice could send our stock prices fluctuating.

7
01:11.997 --> 01:13.757
Way to ramp up the pressure all of a sudden.

8
01:16.657 --> 01:17.661
Hey, um...

9
01:17.744 --> 01:18.744
Hmm?

10
01:21.417 --> 01:23.997
I'm really sorry about the other day.

11
01:24.710 --> 01:25.769
About what?

12
01:26.757 --> 01:31.557
I know we were drinking, but I got way too explicit in front of a lady.

13
01:32.397 --> 01:33.994
Oh, haha.

14
01:34.077 --> 01:35.634
Don't sweat it.

15
01:35.717 --> 01:38.577
I haven't had that much fun drinking in ages.

16
01:39.157 --> 01:40.157
Oh.

17
01:45.355 --> 01:46.355
Huh?

18
01:47.257 --> 01:50.934
Is it possible to see a straight friend in a romantic way?

19
01:51.017 --> 01:54.654
I just saw Ueno-san and Kanda-san coming to work together the other day.

20
01:54.737 --> 01:56.757
It's not like we're particularly close.

21
01:58.577 --> 01:59.577
Ah.

22
02:00.370 --> 02:01.234
Could the person Kanda was talking about be...

23
02:01.317 --> 02:03.757
Didn't we agree to stay out of it?

24
02:05.717 --> 02:09.097
Kanda-san probably hasn't even figured it out himself yet.

25
02:10.697 --> 02:12.057
Y-You have a point.

26
02:12.557 --> 02:15.497
Better safe than sorry, right?

27
02:16.697 --> 02:17.697
Exactly.

28
02:18.397 --> 02:19.397
I'm heading out.

29
02:28.023 --> 02:30.400
Is your friend still staying over?

30
02:33.937 --> 02:35.817
It's not that I'm avoiding him.

31
02:37.017 --> 02:38.317
It's just...

32
02:55.197 --> 02:56.774
I just feel like...

33
02:56.857 --> 03:00.497
after doing something like that behind his back,

34
03:01.556 --> 03:03.850
I can't face Kanda without feeling terrible.

35
03:05.097 --> 03:06.577
I have a guilty conscience.

36
03:15.517 --> 03:16.517
Yeah, still there.

37
03:23.117 --> 03:25.437
Ueno has his own life,

38
03:26.017 --> 03:28.637
and he has his own needs, too.

39
03:29.877 --> 03:31.377
I get all that.

40
03:39.457 --> 03:40.614
So what on earth

41
03:40.697 --> 03:42.197
do I even want to do?

42
03:44.099 --> 03:46.893
(Dad)

43
04:53.585 --> 04:56.121
"You Should Be The One To Come Kiss Me"

44
04:59.117 --> 05:00.208
(Episode 4) Here you go.

45
05:09.976 --> 05:11.061
Sorry about this.

46
05:14.564 --> 05:16.094
If everyone has

47
05:16.177 --> 05:18.277
one or two things

48
05:19.237 --> 05:21.197
they find hard to talk about,

49
05:23.797 --> 05:25.534
then for me,

50
05:25.617 --> 05:27.377
it's my dad.

51
05:33.277 --> 05:34.294
Kanda,

52
05:34.377 --> 05:37.194
congrats on winning the gold prize in the internal competition!

53
05:37.277 --> 05:38.114
Congrats!

54
05:38.197 --> 05:39.497
Thanks.

55
05:41.617 --> 05:42.617
Hey, hey, hey!

56
05:42.677 --> 05:45.077
Since we're celebrating, let's get this deluxe sashimi boat.

57
05:45.757 --> 05:46.757
That's pricey.

58
05:47.257 --> 05:48.990
Come on, don't be so stingy on payday.

59
05:50.317 --> 05:54.774
Kanda's proposal was fun and feasible. It was awesome.

60
05:54.857 --> 05:56.057
You totally deserved the gold.

61
05:56.117 --> 05:57.697
It was just a fluke.

62
05:58.717 --> 05:59.434
Just take the compliment.

63
05:59.517 --> 06:01.034
I'm telling you, I just got lucky.

64
06:01.117 --> 06:02.117
No,

65
06:02.195 --> 06:03.530
I learned a lot from it.

66
06:05.717 --> 06:06.717
Oh, yeah?

67
06:07.830 --> 06:10.834
Your sales numbers are way ahead of everyone else in our year, too.

68
06:10.917 --> 06:12.038
Wow, that's impressive.

69
06:13.417 --> 06:16.677
Watching you makes me anxious about just doing the bare minimum to get by.

70
06:18.077 --> 06:20.497
Where do you get your drive from?

71
06:25.093 --> 06:28.897
I'm just a workaholic, that's all.

72
06:29.517 --> 06:30.877
You're being way too modest.

73
06:32.777 --> 06:34.414
Anyway, what about that sashimi boat?

74
06:34.497 --> 06:37.022
Excuse me! Could we get the deluxe sashimi boat, please?

75
06:37.105 --> 06:38.982
Certainly. Thank you.

76
06:42.617 --> 06:44.077
Alright.

77
06:44.777 --> 06:47.797
Let's keep the party going at Ueno's place after this.

78
06:49.034 --> 06:49.554
What?

79
06:49.637 --> 06:50.714
My place?

80
06:50.797 --> 06:53.037
You let me crash there last time when my power went out.

81
06:53.457 --> 06:54.998
That was only because

82
06:55.081 --> 06:57.054
you said you had nowhere else to go.

83
06:57.137 --> 06:58.714
Come on!

84
06:58.797 --> 06:59.514
Please?

85
06:59.597 --> 07:00.897
Just for tonight.

86
07:03.397 --> 07:04.474
Sorry.

87
07:04.557 --> 07:06.457
Tonight's not a good time.

88
07:15.417 --> 07:16.994
Looks like you're having a good time,

89
07:17.077 --> 07:18.077
Eito.

90
07:23.109 --> 07:24.109
Dad.

91
07:31.237 --> 07:32.285
How much do you want?

92
07:33.677 --> 07:35.080
Don't be like that.

93
07:35.937 --> 07:37.774
I came to see you.

94
07:39.084 --> 07:41.094
The money is just an afterthought...

95
07:41.177 --> 07:42.477
I'll go hit the ATM.

96
07:47.217 --> 07:48.910
Ueno, you go on ahead.

97
07:48.993 --> 07:49.993
Thanks for tonight.

98
07:52.138 --> 07:53.138
Excuse me.

99
08:18.597 --> 08:21.134
I really didn't want Ueno to see that.

100
08:21.217 --> 08:22.217
Sorry for the wait.

101
08:23.837 --> 08:25.422
- Sorry... - It's fine.

102
08:35.098 --> 08:37.937
Someone asked me to start a business with them.

103
08:39.117 --> 08:40.654
Once it gets off the ground,

104
08:40.737 --> 08:42.316
I'll pay you back with interest.

105
08:45.177 --> 08:47.485
Still, he probably won't think much of it.

106
08:51.557 --> 08:54.177
That's just how it is with other people's family drama.

107
08:55.160 --> 08:56.344
I'd do the same.

108
09:00.957 --> 09:03.637
Even if I were a bit surprised, I'd pretend I didn't see anything,

109
09:05.037 --> 09:07.557
make small talk at the office,

110
09:08.797 --> 09:09.883
and just like that,

111
09:11.397 --> 09:12.397
move on.

112
09:20.810 --> 09:21.810
Oh.

113
09:31.196 --> 09:32.489
Found you.

114
09:38.153 --> 09:39.153
Huh?

115
09:39.597 --> 09:40.597
What are you doing here?

116
09:41.497 --> 09:43.197
Are the trains down or something?

117
09:44.537 --> 09:45.894
No, it's not that.

118
09:47.197 --> 09:48.717
I was just a little worried about you.

119
09:50.777 --> 09:52.597
Sorry if I'm overstepping.

120
09:56.737 --> 09:58.031
I figured tonight,

121
09:59.857 --> 10:01.437
you'd want someone to drink with,

122
10:03.277 --> 10:04.577
rather than drinking alone.

123
10:12.357 --> 10:13.357
Yeah.

124
10:15.117 --> 10:16.117
Maybe you're right.

125
10:28.419 --> 10:29.587
(Ueno)

126
10:31.965 --> 10:34.008
(Can I come over right...)

127
10:37.470 --> 10:38.470
Oh, right.

128
10:39.556 --> 10:41.099
It's a bad time for him.

129
10:46.646 --> 10:47.646
(Sorry, wrong text)

130
10:47.677 --> 10:48.774
Excuse me.

131
10:48.857 --> 10:51.757
Your table time is just about up.

132
10:52.757 --> 10:54.057
Oh, sorry.

133
11:53.417 --> 11:55.477
Isn't this Ueno's stop?

134
12:10.617 --> 12:13.399
What am I, some needy attention-seeker?

135
12:19.617 --> 12:21.115
Even without Ueno,

136
12:22.257 --> 12:24.160
I can just sleep it off and bounce back.

137
12:24.957 --> 12:27.897
I can get by just fine.

138
12:29.757 --> 12:30.808
Even without...

139
12:32.437 --> 12:33.561
Ueno.

140
12:34.754 --> 12:35.754
Kanda?

141
12:40.377 --> 12:41.219
Hey.

142
12:41.302 --> 12:42.470
What's with

143
12:42.553 --> 12:43.763
this text?

144
12:47.657 --> 12:49.160
Yesterday was payday.

145
12:50.277 --> 12:51.737
Your dad showed up, didn't he?

146
12:54.607 --> 12:55.650
Are you okay?

147
12:58.137 --> 12:59.137
Oh.

148
12:59.988 --> 13:00.988
Uh...

149
13:01.948 --> 13:02.948
Sorry.

150
13:03.908 --> 13:06.469
It's nothing, really.

151
13:08.037 --> 13:09.037
Wait,

152
13:09.677 --> 13:11.457
how did you know I was here?

153
13:15.253 --> 13:17.213
Whenever you don't know where to go,

154
13:18.217 --> 13:19.857
you usually end up wandering around here.

155
13:23.417 --> 13:24.717
I do?

156
13:34.063 --> 13:35.314
Oh.

157
13:35.397 --> 13:38.357
Right, your friend is still at your place, yeah?

158
13:39.402 --> 13:42.363
Seeing your face is enough for me. I'll head home now.

159
13:44.057 --> 13:45.057
See ya.

160
13:46.200 --> 13:47.243
Kanda.

161
13:50.557 --> 13:51.581
Are you really

162
13:52.665 --> 13:53.665
okay?

163
13:58.254 --> 13:59.254
Man, I'm in trouble.

164
14:02.383 --> 14:03.676
What is this feeling?

165
14:06.721 --> 14:08.014
I want to lean on him.

166
14:16.877 --> 14:18.457
I want him all to myself.

167
14:29.117 --> 14:30.117
Oh.

168
14:30.578 --> 14:31.578
Hmm?

169
14:32.455 --> 14:33.748
I'm out of beer.

170
14:34.537 --> 14:35.537
You want a drink, right?

171
14:36.097 --> 14:37.397
Oh, yeah.

172
14:38.770 --> 14:40.337
Actually, never mind.

173
14:42.337 --> 14:43.637
No, wait.

174
14:44.297 --> 14:45.597
I do want one.

175
14:49.277 --> 14:50.577
Make up your mind.

176
14:58.477 --> 15:00.191
I'll go buy some.

177
15:00.274 --> 15:01.334
Oh, I'll come with you.

178
15:01.417 --> 15:02.502
No need.

179
15:03.077 --> 15:04.377
Just get some rest.

180
15:17.959 --> 15:19.293
Ugh...

181
15:20.920 --> 15:24.357
All of a sudden, I don't know what to talk to him about.

182
15:25.133 --> 15:27.343
How did I used to act around him?

183
15:53.202 --> 15:54.929
I knew it'd be here.

184
16:20.057 --> 16:21.897
I really am just begging for his attention.

185
17:15.857 --> 17:17.136
Sorry that took so...

186
17:33.970 --> 17:35.096
Welcome back.

187
17:35.997 --> 17:37.977
Sorry, did I wake you?

188
17:40.797 --> 17:42.574
I'm wide awake.

189
17:42.657 --> 17:44.117
Yeah, right. You were totally out.

190
17:47.857 --> 17:49.417
You bought a ton of stuff.

191
17:51.097 --> 17:52.933
The convenience store didn't have any good snacks to go with drinks,

192
17:52.957 --> 17:54.616
so I went over to the shopping district.

193
17:54.699 --> 17:55.614
Seriously?

194
17:55.697 --> 17:57.157
Thanks for going out of your way.

195
17:58.857 --> 18:00.497
Oh, let me help.

196
18:00.580 --> 18:01.789
No, I got it.

197
18:02.737 --> 18:04.977
I just need to plate them and pop them in the microwave.

198
18:06.017 --> 18:07.311
Come on, let me help.

199
18:48.297 --> 18:49.994
Something really did happen, didn't it?

200
18:50.077 --> 18:51.134
With your dad.

201
18:51.217 --> 18:52.217
Huh?

202
18:53.057 --> 18:54.091
Why do you ask?

203
18:54.677 --> 18:55.677
No reason.

204
18:56.093 --> 18:57.386
You just seem a little off.

205
18:58.888 --> 19:00.973
I'm all ears if you want to talk about it.

206
19:03.117 --> 19:04.143
No, not at all.

207
19:05.353 --> 19:07.455
My dad was just his usual self.

208
19:16.477 --> 19:18.017
Just sit still and behave.

209
19:25.665 --> 19:26.665
Okay.

210
19:37.057 --> 19:39.153
These minced meat cutlets are amazing.

211
19:40.971 --> 19:44.350
I heard the ones from the butcher in the shopping arcade are really good.

212
19:44.850 --> 19:45.850
Who told you that?

213
19:47.603 --> 19:48.896
The internet.

214
19:49.855 --> 19:50.855
Glad I got them.

215
19:53.192 --> 19:56.437
I figured you'd like them, Kanda.

216
20:07.817 --> 20:09.697
Oh, right.

217
20:10.334 --> 20:11.519
You left this behind.

218
20:17.550 --> 20:18.776
Here, before I forget.

219
20:20.037 --> 20:21.037
Oh.

220
20:29.812 --> 20:32.022
Wanna play video games later?

221
20:33.037 --> 20:34.757
I haven't bought the game yet, though.

222
20:38.821 --> 20:40.034
I have it.

223
20:40.117 --> 20:41.117
Huh?

224
20:46.477 --> 20:47.777
You bought it?

225
20:48.557 --> 20:50.416
And it's the exact one I wanted to play.

226
20:54.297 --> 20:55.754
This guy...

227
20:55.837 --> 20:58.297
I really can't figure him out sometimes.

228
20:58.957 --> 21:01.237
He's not quite what you'd expect.

229
21:02.537 --> 21:04.097
I figured on a day like today,

230
21:05.639 --> 21:07.239
you'd want someone to have a drink with.

231
21:10.297 --> 21:11.871
Whether it was back then or today,

232
21:12.697 --> 21:16.317
how do I put it? There are surprisingly many sides to him.

233
21:20.237 --> 21:21.274
What's wrong?

234
21:21.357 --> 21:22.357
Does your stomach hurt?

235
21:28.788 --> 21:29.788
Right now...

236
21:35.795 --> 21:36.795
I really

237
21:37.797 --> 21:40.417
just want Ueno to spoil me.

238
21:46.637 --> 21:47.937
By the way,

239
21:49.725 --> 21:50.868
are you sure this is okay?

240
21:51.517 --> 21:52.817
What about that friend of yours?

241
21:54.717 --> 21:55.717
They didn't

242
21:56.617 --> 21:57.617
come over today.

243
22:00.077 --> 22:01.077
Oh, I see...

244
22:26.011 --> 22:27.680
And here I even bought edamame mochi.

245
22:28.317 --> 22:29.599
What?

246
22:29.682 --> 22:30.766
The souvenir from Sendai.

247
22:31.497 --> 22:33.410
It expired, so I just ate it myself.

248
22:34.727 --> 22:35.855
Oh, right.

249
22:42.197 --> 22:44.857
Actually, it wasn't a friend.

250
22:48.837 --> 22:51.397
It was someone I met on a dating app.

251
22:54.248 --> 22:55.248
How do I put this?

252
22:55.877 --> 22:59.645
I'd feel weird having a friend over right after doing that.

253
23:06.417 --> 23:07.514
Wouldn't it gross you out?

254
23:07.597 --> 23:09.077
From the guest's perspective, I mean.

255
23:10.217 --> 23:11.223
Oh...

256
23:12.777 --> 23:14.137
I wouldn't really know about that.

257
23:16.637 --> 23:18.777
That caught me off guard.

258
23:20.977 --> 23:23.417
It's so rare for Ueno to bring up stuff like this on his own.

259
23:24.557 --> 23:25.780
Come to think of it,

260
23:25.863 --> 23:27.156
isn't this the very first time?

261
23:28.337 --> 23:29.242
Oh.

262
23:29.325 --> 23:32.786
By the way, this month's new releases are up on the streaming site.

263
23:36.617 --> 23:39.217
If they hit it off, will they start dating?

264
23:39.777 --> 23:43.437
Or are they just friends with benefits?

265
23:47.197 --> 23:48.517
No, more importantly...

266
23:49.417 --> 23:51.614
The fact that he doesn't mind me knowing

267
23:51.697 --> 23:54.757
that he's seeing someone like that means...

268
23:57.237 --> 23:58.857
To Ueno,

269
23:59.757 --> 24:01.537
am I just that kind of

270
24:03.037 --> 24:04.337
good friend now?

271
24:08.857 --> 24:10.157
This...

272
24:11.992 --> 24:13.118
It makes me...

273
24:15.204 --> 24:16.246
It makes me...

274
24:18.777 --> 24:21.157
At first, I thought there was no way.

275
24:21.717 --> 24:23.057
But surprisingly, I was into it.

276
24:29.718 --> 24:29.969
Huh?

277
24:30.052 --> 24:32.297
Hey, you're spilling it.

278
24:34.377 --> 24:35.677
Seriously...

279
24:40.104 --> 24:41.104
Oh.

280
24:41.605 --> 24:42.605
Hmm?

281
24:43.237 --> 24:44.537
Hey...

282
24:46.317 --> 24:47.617
Instead of them...

283
24:48.946 --> 24:50.030
why can't it be me?

284
24:56.417 --> 24:57.417
Just kidding.

285
24:59.917 --> 25:03.714
(Next Episode Preview) I just hope Kanda-san doesn't get hurt.

286
25:03.797 --> 25:06.757
If he ends up crying, the least I can do is give him a shoulder to cry on.

287
25:07.257 --> 25:08.294
Did you go all the way?

288
25:08.377 --> 25:09.757
No!

289
25:10.297 --> 25:13.557
I want us to pretend that day never happened.
